  <component name="VcsManagerConfiguration">
    <MESSAGE value="fix(cl,ssa): preserve defer/go action semantics for atomic builtins&#10;&#10;Fixes #1686.&#10;&#10;Root cause: atomic builtins were lowered as direct calls in action paths, so defer/go handling was bypassed for these operations. Under complex control flow this could break defer semantics and produce invalid IR instruction ordering (e.g. protobuf/internal/impl).&#10;&#10;What changed:&#10;&#10;- Threaded an explicit call-builder through Builder.Do/Go/Defer.&#10;&#10;- Routed atomic builtin lowering in cl/instr.go through this action-aware path instead of direct emission.&#10;&#10;- Added nil-safe handling in defer/go/logging paths for builtin-style calls.&#10;&#10;- Updated defer runtime lowering helpers accordingly (ssa/eh.go, ssa/expr.go, ssa/goroutine.go).&#10;&#10;Regression coverage:&#10;&#10;- Added cl/_testgo/deferatomic with generated out.ll and expect.txt.&#10;&#10;- Extended runtime-facing defer/go atomic tests in test/defer_test.go.&#10;&#10;- Kept SSA-level defer/eh tests aligned with the new call-builder signatures.&#10;&#10;Signed-off-by: ZhouGuangyuan &lt;zhouguangyuan.xian@gmail.com&gt;" />
    <MESSAGE value="fix(cl,ssa,runtime): route sync/atomic builtins through action-aware lowering&#10;&#10;Fixes #1686.&#10;&#10;Atomic intrinsics were previously emitted directly, which bypassed the defer/go lowering path and could break action semantics or instruction ordering under complex control flow.&#10;&#10;This change threads an explicit call builder through Builder.Do/Go/Defer, lets builtin-style operations execute through the same action-aware path as regular calls, and makes the defer/go helpers tolerate builtin-backed calls that do not carry a callable Expr.&#10;&#10;It also switches sync/atomic to the llgo runtime replacement package and exposes CompareAndSwap*/Add* entry points through dedicated llgo intrinsics so those operations can be lowered correctly in normal, defer, and go contexts.&#10;&#10;Signed-off-by: ZhouGuangyuan &lt;zhouguangyuan.xian@gmail.com&gt;" />
    <MESSAGE value="llvm20 + fake use for equal" />
    <MESSAGE value="fulllto with globaldce" />
